{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rencheng-e-bc46395a2b1d2cdb0eca","title":"阴澹魏纪载曹植登台赋并称曹操深异","accounts":[{"id":"rencheng-a-bc46395a2b1d2cdb0eca","label":"裴注·魏纪","text":"阴澹魏纪载曹植登台赋并称曹操深异","evidence":["rencheng-q-1798bf5333795af3279a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0280","role":"赋作者","evidence":["rencheng-q-1798bf5333795af3279a"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"赞赏者","evidence":["rencheng-q-1798bf5333795af3279a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["rencheng-q-1798bf5333795af3279a"]},"ordering_evidence":"rencheng-q-1798bf5333795af3279a","order":3758}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0280","name":"曹植","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rencheng-q-1798bf5333795af3279a","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-0cd23634ce42bf4cbcd3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞阴澹《魏纪》载：“植赋曰‘从明后而嬉游兮，登层台以娱情。见太府之广开兮，观圣德之所营：建高门之嵯峨兮，浮双阙乎太清；立中天之华观兮，连飞阁乎西城。临漳水之长流兮，望园果之滋荣；仰春风之和穆兮，听百鸟之悲鸣。天云垣其既立兮，家愿得而获逞。扬仁化于宇内兮，尽肃恭于上京；惟桓文之为盛兮，岂足方乎圣明？休矣美矣，惠泽远扬。翼佐我皇家兮，宁彼四方。同天地之规量兮，齐日月之晖光。永贵尊而无极兮，等年寿于东王’云云。太祖深异之。”","attribution":"裴注·魏纪","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5815f006edd38f9201c5","start":0,"end":213,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
